Column name: spc_latin Type: TEXT Description: The scientific name of the species.
Column name: borocode Type: NUMBER Description: Borough tree is in, using a one-digit borough code: 1 – Manhattan, 2 – Bronx, 3 – Brooklyn, 4 – Queens, 5 – Staten Island
