Table full name: NEW_YORK.NEW_YORK.TLC_GREEN_TRIPS_2015
Column name: dropoff_longitude Type: FLOAT
Column name: tolls_amount Type: FLOAT Description: Total amount of all tolls paid in trip.
Column name: trip_type Type: NUMBER Description: A code indicating whether the trip was a street-hail or a dispatch that is automatically assigned based on the metered rate in use but can be altered by the driver. 1= Street-hail 2= Dispatch
Column name: pickup_latitude Type: FLOAT
Column name: passenger_count Type: NUMBER Description: The number of passengers in the vehicle. This is a driver-entered value.
Column name: fare_amount Type: FLOAT Description: The time-and-distance fare calculated by the meter
Column name: tip_amount Type: FLOAT Description: Tip amount. This field is automatically populated for credit card tips. Cash tips are not included.
Column name: total_amount Type: FLOAT Description: The total amount charged to passengers. Does not include cash tips.
Column name: store_and_fwd_flag Type: TEXT Description: This flag indicates whether the trip record was held in vehicle memory before sending to the vendor, aka 'store and forward,' because the vehicle did not have a connection to the server. Y= store and forward trip N= not a store and forward trip
Column name: trip_distance Type: FLOAT Description: The elapsed trip distance in miles reported by the taximeter.
Column name: extra Type: FLOAT Description: Miscellaneous extras and surcharges. Currently, this only includes the $0.50 and $1 rush hour and overnight charges
Column name: time_between_service Type: NUMBER
Column name: ehail_fee Type: FLOAT
Column name: distance_between_service Type: FLOAT
Column name: rate_code Type: NUMBER Description: The final rate code in effect at the end of the trip. 1= Standard rate 2=JFK 3=Newark 4=Nassau or Westchester 5=Negotiated fare 6=Group ride
Column name: vendor_id Type: TEXT Description: A code indicating the LPEP provider that provided the record. 1= Creative Mobile Technologies, LLC; 2= VeriFone Inc.
Column name: dropoff_datetime Type: NUMBER Description: The date and time when the meter was disengaged
Column name: dropoff_latitude Type: FLOAT
Column name: pickup_datetime Type: NUMBER Description: The date and time when the meter was engaged
Column name: mta_tax Type: FLOAT Description: $0.50 MTA tax that is automatically triggered based on the metered rate in use
Column name: pickup_longitude Type: FLOAT
Column name: payment_type Type: NUMBER Description: A numeric code signifying how the passenger paid for the trip. 1= Credit card 2= Cash 3= No charge 4= Dispute 5= Unknown 6= Voided trip
Column name: imp_surcharge Type: FLOAT Description: $0.30 improvement surcharge assessed on hailed trips at the flag drop. The improvement surcharge began being levied in 2015.
