Column name: trip_type Type: NUMBER Description: A code indicating whether the trip was a street-hail or a dispatch that is automatically assigned based on the metered rate in use but can be altered by the driver. 1= Street-hail 2= Dispatch
Column name: extra Type: FLOAT Description: Miscellaneous extras and surcharges. Currently, this only includes the $0.50 and $1 rush hour and overnight charges
Column name: pickup_longitude Type: FLOAT
Column name: payment_type Type: NUMBER Description: A numeric code signifying how the passenger paid for the trip. 1= Credit card 2= Cash 3= No charge 4= Dispute 5= Unknown 6= Voided trip
Column name: distance_between_service Type: FLOAT
Column name: fare_amount Type: FLOAT Description: The time-and-distance fare calculated by the meter
